Scenario A file that carries categories imports them
Description This is the migration path. An export of twenty years of history
\ names the category of each transaction, and taking it saves
\ recategorising everything by hand. A category named in the file but
\ not in the book is created, as in Accounts.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                   | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking        | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Groceries     | Expense | false       |
| Expenses:Uncategorized | Expense | false       |
Given the csv profile is : CsvProfile Vertical
| Name           | Quicken Export |
| DateColumn     | Date           |
| PayeeColumn    | Payee          |
| CategoryColumn | Category       |
| AmountStyle    | Signed         |
| AmountColumn   | Amount         |
