Date,Payee,Category,Amount
01/15/2024,Harris Teeter,Expenses:Groceries,-45.00
01/16/2024,Shell,Expenses:Auto:Fuel,-52.00
01/17/2024,Unknown,,-10.00
"""
Given import target is : ImportTarget Vertical
| AccountPath | Assets:Checking |
When rows imported
Then transactions are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee         | Destination            | Amount | Cleared |
| T1  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter | Expenses:Groceries     | -45.00 | Cleared |
| T2  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-16 | Shell         | Expenses:Auto:Fuel     | -52.00 | Cleared |
| T3  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-17 | Unknown       | Expenses:Uncategorized | -10.00 | Cleared |
Then accounts created are : ChartOfAccounts
| Path               | Type    | Placeholder |
| Expenses:Auto      | Expense | true        |
| Expenses:Auto:Fuel | Expense | false       |

