Scenario Re-importing the same CSV file does nothing the second time
Description One row in the file and the one it created in the book: the counts
\ agree, so it is a duplicate and nothing is created. This is the whole
\ point of reading a file twice being safe, and the earlier rule --
\ which offered every row again -- made a monthly download a monthly
\ questionnaire.
